@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy & Store Terms";
}

<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <div class="p-4 p-md-5 bg-white rounded-4 border shadow-sm">
        <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--brand-rose);">Privacy Policy & Store Policies</h1>
        
        <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mt-4">1. Privacy & Data Collection</h4>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            At AarMaabd, we respect your privacy. We collect only necessary delivery information (name, phone number, and delivery address) to fulfill your orders and keep you updated on delivery status. We do not store card credentials or plain passwords.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mt-4">2. Cash on Delivery (COD) & Online Payments</h4>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            We provide Cash on Delivery (COD) across Dhaka and all divisional districts in Bangladesh. We also accept instant verified online payments via bKash, Nagad, and local Debit/Credit cards.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mt-4">3. Fresh Food & Perishables Policy</h4>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            Artisan cakes, cupcakes, and savory foods are prepared fresh upon order placement. For custom cakes, we request a 24–48 hour advance booking so we can bake and decorate your order with care.
        </p>

        <h4 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mt-4">4. Returns & Replacement</h4>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            If you receive any damaged or incorrect item, please notify our team within 24 hours of delivery with photographic evidence. We will gladly arrange an exchange or compensation according to our customer satisfaction guarantee.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top text-muted small">
            Last updated: October 2026 • AarMaabd Bangladesh
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
